Subject: [PATCH] Backend: inbound pipeline, knowledge base, grounded AI
 replies with handoff and run tracing

- migration 0004: message dedupe + ordering, one active conversation per customer/channel,
  knowledge_documents/chunks, ai_runs (one per inbound message), handoffs; RLS on all new tables
- ConversationPipeline: idempotent inbound, customer/conversation resolution under races,
  human-request detection, BM25 retrieval with coverage gate, strict JSON grounded answers,
  atomic reply/handoff + trace, stale-reply discard on human takeover
- model gateway interface, scripted test gateway, Anthropic adapter (mocked-fetch tested only)
- Arabic-aware normalization/light stemming, chunker, retrieval evaluation harness
- endpoints: knowledge documents, conversation messages, handoffs; permissions knowledge.read/manage
- createMessage now dedupes on clientMessageId (202 created / 200 replay)
- assigning a human claims the open handoff
- tests: 106 across memory and Postgres, introspective RLS check for every tenant table
